Codex CLI is not installed. recite uses your ChatGPT sign-in through Codex.
  Install it with npm (macOS, Linux):
      npm install -g @openai/codex
  or with Homebrew (macOS):
      brew install --cask codex
  or with the install script (macOS, Linux):
      curl -fsSL https://chatgpt.com/codex/install.sh | sh
  Then sign in:
      CODEX_HOME=/srv/codex-home codex login
More help: https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/auth
